@startuml audio_state
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam ArrowFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor #273241
 BorderColor #61738a
 FontColor #e6edf7
 AttributeFontColor #cdd5d5
 BackgroundColor<<running>> #10302b
 BorderColor<<running>> #52c7b4
 BackgroundColor<<fault>> #2a1714
 BorderColor<<fault>> #f08a7c
 BackgroundColor<<unclear>> #3a3320
 BorderColor<<unclear>> #dcbb63
}
skinparam note {
 BackgroundColor #1b2533
 BorderColor #61738a
 FontColor #e6edf7
}
title L2_AUDIO states and the system states they correspond to (design, not implemented)
hide empty description
state "Initializing" as Initializing : i2s_initialize\nsystem: Boot
state "Stopped" as Stopped : no stream; output silent; waits for commands\nsystem: Idle, Portal, Analysing, Sending, ReportingError
state "Starting" as Starting : i2s_start: configure both links,\nprime 4 silent TX blocks, start RX, then TX\nsystem: unclear
state "Running" as Running <<running>> : block loop, one iteration per 4 ms, ≤ 3 ms (P02)\nsystem: Listening, Measuring (shared design: Live)
state "Stopping" as Stopping : i2s_stop (Stop sequence)\nsystem: Listening → Idle,\nMeasuring → Idle or Analysing
state "Fault" as Fault <<fault>> : both links stopped; waits for commands\nsystem: Muted (shared design: Error, audio affected)
[*] --> Initializing : boot
Initializing --> Stopped : both devices ready, links configured
Initializing --> Fault : device not ready or configuration failed\n/ failure reported to L2_CONTROL
Stopped --> Starting : Start command
Starting --> Running : priming and start succeed\n/ started event
Starting --> Fault : a link fails to start\n/ i2s_start stops both links, start failure reported
Running --> Stopping : Stop command, checked once per iteration
Stopping --> Stopped : / stopped event; all pool blocks free
Running --> Fault : receive or TX-block wait over 20 ms (P11),\ndriver error, for example > 12 ms behind\n/ i2s_stop, fault event with the failed link
Running --> Running : Wi-Fi-only fault\n/ audio preserved (P12)
Fault --> [*] : device restart (catalogue: restart required)
note bottom of Fault
  No automatic stream restart (decision of 11 November).
  L2_CONTROL blocks Start while system Muted.
  What L2_AUDIO does with a Start received in Fault: unclear.
end note
note left of Running
  **unclear**: non-audio halting fault (system Muted,
  for example SESSION_CONTEXT_CHANGE). Whether
  L2_CONTROL then sends Stop (to Stopping) or how
  the output is muted is not documented for AUDIO.
end note
note right of Starting
  Whether the system enters Listening at the Start
  command or at the started event: unclear.
end note
@enduml
